	(text "RP2354B (RP2350B + 2 MB flash in package): the FROB RAM, control register and both mailboxes in firmware.\nCore 0 serves the Apple bus (left), core 1 the 2600 bus (right).  Pin map = firmware/src/frob_pins.h.\nGP40-47 (ADC pads) are NOT 5 V tolerant: they only see 3.3 V buffer outputs.\nBOOTSEL: hold SW2, press SW1 (RESET), copy the UF2.  SWD on TP1/TP2."
